      ["How do you ask 'Where do you want to go?'", ["Qhov twg koj xav mus?", "Mus qhov twg koj xav?", "Koj xav mus qhov twg?", "Koj xav qhov twg mus?"], 2, "The question word stays where the answer goes, after the verb mus."],
      ["What does los tsis yog add at the end of a sentence?", ["why?", "who?", "when?", "or not?"], 3, "los tsis yog means or not? and turns a statement into a yes-or-no question."]
